{"storyMeta":{"storyReviewType":"NONE","storyId":"act43side_level_act43side_04_beg","storyGroup":"act43side","storySort":8,"storyDependence":"act43side_level_act43side_03_end","storyCanShow":1,"storyCode":"AD-4","storyName":"一个荒唐的早晨","storyPic":null,"storyInfo":"迈克尔回忆起劳拉的坠亡，他想携玛丽昂一同逃离地块。卢西恩越来越确信剧团长就在这里，他回忆起自己最初想要逃离剧团的理由，坚定了再次杀死剧团长的决心。","storyCanEnter":1,"storyTxt":"activities/act43side/level_act43side_04_beg","avgTag":"行动前","unLockType":"BY_START_TIME","costItemType":"NONE","costItemId":null,"costItemCount":0,"stageCount":1,"requiredStages":[{"stageId":"act43side_04","minState":"PLAYED","maxState":"COMPLETE"}],"prev":6,"next":8,"characters":["劳拉","道尔顿","谢莉","迈克尔","玛丽昂","工作人员","剧团长","小卢西恩","卢西恩","懵懂的孩童","沉渊","Miss.Christine"]},"lines":[{"type":"header","key":"title_test","skippable":"true","mode":"BLACK_MASK","id":0},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":1},{"type":"stopmusic","id":2},{"type":"dialog","id":3},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":4},{"type":"cameraeffect","effect":"Grayscale","fadetime":"0","keep":"true","initamount":"0","amount":"1","block":"true","id":5},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/61/Avg_bg_62_g2_setting_rooftop.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":6},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":7},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":8},{"type":"cameraeffect","effect":"Grayscale","fadetime":"2","amount":"0","block":"true","id":9},{"type":"playmusic","intro":"$darkness01_intro","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/beta1_180603/m_dia_darkness01_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":10,"musicid":0},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1848_1#1$1","duration":"1","id":11},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":12},{"type":"dialogue","name":"劳拉","text":"道尔顿先生，您竟然真的替我多要了一场戏……还是空中悬吊的特技镜头？","id":13,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a7/Avg_avg_npc_1848_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"劳拉","text":"之前我怎么求斯蒂芬导演他都不愿意，您一说他竟然就答应了？","id":14,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a7/Avg_avg_npc_1848_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":15},{"type":"charslot","id":16},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1837_1#2$1","duration":"1","id":17},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":18},{"type":"dialogue","name":"道尔顿","text":"小意思。我是格蕾塔女士亲自请来的男主演，斯蒂芬怎么敢不答应我的要求？","id":19,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b7/Avg_avg_npc_1837_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1848_1#1$1","id":20},{"type":"dialogue","name":"劳拉","text":"我还是第一次接触威亚……一定会好好地珍惜这次机会的！我先去准备了！","id":21,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a7/Avg_avg_npc_1848_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1837_1#2$1","id":22},{"type":"dialogue","name":"道尔顿","text":"去吧。","id":23,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b7/Avg_avg_npc_1837_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":24},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1848_1#1$1","id":25},{"type":"playsound","key":"$rungeneral","loop":"true","channel":"bgs","id":26},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"bgs","fadetime":"2.5","id":27},{"type":"charslot","duration":"1.5","id":28},{"type":"delay","time":"2.5","id":29},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1837_1#6$1","id":30},{"type":"dialogue","name":"道尔顿","text":"装得倒谦卑，要是我不知道你暗地里找斯蒂芬想动我主演的戏份，大概就被你骗过去了。","id":31,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/fb/Avg_avg_npc_1837_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1837_1#2$1","id":32},{"type":"dialogue","name":"道尔顿","text":"第一次接触威亚……正好。","id":33,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b7/Avg_avg_npc_1837_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"道尔顿","text":"新人就应该有新人的姿态，就算到时候在天上吊上几个小时，也得撑住，对吧？","id":34,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b7/Avg_avg_npc_1837_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":35},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":36},{"type":"charslot","id":37},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d0/Avg_bg_bg_warehouse.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":38},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":39},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1848_1#1$1","duration":"1","id":40},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":41},{"type":"dialogue","name":"劳拉","text":"谢莉，谢莉！我又新加了一场戏，需要用一下威亚，你可以帮我准备一下吗？","id":42,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a7/Avg_avg_npc_1848_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1836_1#1$1","id":43},{"type":"dialogue","name":"谢莉","text":"……不可能。","id":44,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/15/Avg_avg_npc_1836_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"谢莉","text":"我知道你很爱演戏，我也知道你很有热情，但你这是第几次新加戏了？你这是第几次扰乱我为整个剧组定下的拍摄进度了？","id":45,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/15/Avg_avg_npc_1836_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"谢莉","text":"大小姐，你有一点点责任心吗？我不会为了你这样轻飘飘的一句话改动整个排期，这个剧组不是围着你一个人转的。","id":46,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/15/Avg_avg_npc_1836_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1848_1#1$1","id":47},{"type":"dialogue","name":"劳拉","text":"抱歉谢莉，我不是故意要增加你的工作难度，但是道尔顿先生说他已经征得了导演的同意，这个应该是已经定下了的……","id":48,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a7/Avg_avg_npc_1848_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1836_1#6$1","id":49},{"type":"dialogue","name":"谢莉","text":"道尔顿？","id":50,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b5/Avg_avg_npc_1836_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"谢莉","text":"……","id":51,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b5/Avg_avg_npc_1836_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1836_1#1$1","id":52},{"type":"dialogue","name":"谢莉","text":"我知道了。","id":53,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/15/Avg_avg_npc_1836_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1848_1#1$1","id":54},{"type":"dialogue","name":"劳拉","text":"谢谢你，谢莉！","id":55,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a7/Avg_avg_npc_1848_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":56},{"type":"playsound","key":"$rungeneral","loop":"true","channel":"bgs","id":57},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"bgs","fadetime":"2.5","id":58},{"type":"charslot","duration":"1.5","id":59},{"type":"delay","time":"2.5","id":60},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1836_1#1$1","id":61},{"type":"dialogue","name":"谢莉","text":"（道尔顿昨天才和我骂过你一点新人的规矩都没有，怎么可能今天就好心给你加戏。）","id":62,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/15/Avg_avg_npc_1836_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"谢莉","text":"（威亚，是吧……）","id":63,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/15/Avg_avg_npc_1836_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":64},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":65},{"type":"charslot","id":66},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/5c/Avg_bg_62_g12_dressingroom.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":67},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":68},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1838_1#1$1","duration":"1","id":69},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":70},{"type":"dialogue","name":"迈克尔","text":"哇，小劳拉，今天看上去真是光彩照人啊！下一场空中特技镜头又累又苦，没有一个演员会像你这么高兴……","id":71,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/92/Avg_avg_npc_1838_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1848_1#1$1","id":72},{"type":"dialogue","name":"劳拉","text":"可现在是我最兴奋最幸福的时候了。下一场戏是这部电影里唯一一场完完整整属于我的戏份，我一定要把它拍好。","id":73,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a7/Avg_avg_npc_1848_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1838_1#1$1","id":74},{"type":"dialogue","name":"迈克尔","text":"哦，你真是太可爱了。","id":75,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/92/Avg_avg_npc_1838_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"迈克尔","text":"千万别伤到自己，你要是实在累得不行了就来找我，今天晚上我会一直在自己的房间里……","id":76,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/92/Avg_avg_npc_1838_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1848_1#1$1","id":77},{"type":"dialogue","name":"劳拉","text":"啊！玛丽昂小姐，你是来帮迈克尔先生补妆的吗？","id":78,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a7/Avg_avg_npc_1848_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1839_1#1$1","id":79},{"type":"dialogue","name":"玛丽昂","text":"……","id":80,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/56/Avg_avg_npc_1839_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1848_1#1$1","id":81},{"type":"dialogue","name":"劳拉","text":"那我先去做准备了，晚点再见！","id":82,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a7/Avg_avg_npc_1848_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":83},{"type":"charslot","duration":"1.5","id":84},{"type":"playsound","key":"$rungeneral","loop":"true","channel":"bgs","id":85},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"bgs","fadetime":"2.5","id":86},{"type":"delay","time":"2.5","id":87},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1838_1#1$1","duration":"0.5","id":88},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1839_1#1$1","duration":"0.5","id":89},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":90},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1838_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":91},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1839_1#5$1","focus":"r","id":92},{"type":"dialogue","name":"玛丽昂","text":"见什么见！","id":93,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a2/Avg_avg_npc_1839_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1838_1#3$1","focus":"l","id":94},{"type":"dialogue","name":"迈克尔","text":"不、不见……不见……你别生气啊小玛丽。","id":95,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/04/Avg_avg_npc_1838_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1839_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":96},{"type":"dialogue","name":"玛丽昂","text":"一不在我眼皮子底下就开始拈花惹草？我们才在一起多久你就厌倦了？","id":97,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/56/Avg_avg_npc_1839_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"玛丽昂","text":"演戏的时候就在眉来眼去……喜欢年轻的就去找她啊，吊着我干嘛？之后的妆造你也让劳拉帮你做吧！","id":98,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/56/Avg_avg_npc_1839_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":99},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","posfrom":"0,0","posto":"100,0","duration":"1","id":100},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":101},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1838_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":102},{"type":"dialogue","name":"迈克尔","text":"别说气话，亲爱的。我对你是真心实意的。","id":103,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/92/Avg_avg_npc_1838_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"迈克尔","text":"要是你真的不喜欢，我以后再也不主动接触她了，我发誓！","id":104,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/92/Avg_avg_npc_1838_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1839_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":105},{"type":"dialogue","name":"玛丽昂","text":"……真的？","id":106,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/56/Avg_avg_npc_1839_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1838_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":107},{"type":"dialogue","name":"迈克尔","text":"真的！","id":108,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/92/Avg_avg_npc_1838_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1839_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":109},{"type":"dialogue","name":"玛丽昂","text":"……","id":110,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/56/Avg_avg_npc_1839_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"玛丽昂","text":"我知道你的那点小毛病，但现在正是你事业的上升期，不要做那些蠢事，也不要辜负我对你的心意。","id":111,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/56/Avg_avg_npc_1839_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"玛丽昂","text":"那个叫劳拉的年轻女孩既聒噪又招摇，她一定没安好心，不值得你花心思。","id":112,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/56/Avg_avg_npc_1839_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"玛丽昂","text":"从现在开始，别主动接近她。","id":113,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/56/Avg_avg_npc_1839_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1839_1#5$1","focus":"r","id":114},{"type":"dialogue","name":"玛丽昂","text":"你不能跟她说话，也不能有肢体接触，哪怕她快死了都跟你没有关系……听明白了吗？","id":115,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a2/Avg_avg_npc_1839_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1838_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":116},{"type":"dialogue","name":"迈克尔","text":"亲爱的？","id":117,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/92/Avg_avg_npc_1838_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":118},{"type":"text","text":"玛丽昂的眼神告诉他，她没开玩笑。","id":119},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1838_1#4$1","focus":"l","id":120},{"type":"dialogue","name":"迈克尔","text":"我明白了，我答应你，全按你说的办。","id":121,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/e7/Avg_avg_npc_1838_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":122},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":123},{"type":"charslot","id":124},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":125},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/61/Avg_bg_62_g2_setting_rooftop.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":126},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":127},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":128},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1838_1#2$1","duration":"0.5","id":129},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":130},{"type":"dialogue","name":"迈克尔","text":"怎么还没到我的戏份啊，发生什么了？","id":131,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/dd/Avg_avg_npc_1838_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1845_1#1$1","id":132},{"type":"dialogue","name":"工作人员","text":"道尔顿先生那儿有些事要处理，片场的人都调过去了，没有人给我下达指示……你看，还有个新人被晾在这儿呢。","id":133,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b7/Avg_avg_npc_1845_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1838_1#4$1","id":134},{"type":"dialogue","name":"迈克尔","text":"唉，真可怜……","id":135,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/e7/Avg_avg_npc_1838_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1845_1#1$1","id":136},{"type":"dialogue","name":"工作人员","text":"你可不是同情心这么丰富的人，说吧，是不是想勾搭人家？","id":137,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b7/Avg_avg_npc_1845_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1838_1#1$1","id":138},{"type":"dialogue","name":"迈克尔","text":"还是你了解我。","id":139,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/92/Avg_avg_npc_1838_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"迈克尔","text":"让我去看看那个可怜的小美人……","id":140,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/92/Avg_avg_npc_1838_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":141},{"type":"dialog","id":142},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_gen_walk_n","id":143},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1.5","block":"true","id":144},{"type":"charslot","id":145},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1.5","block":"true","id":146},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1838_1#1$1","duration":"0.5","id":147},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":148},{"type":"dialogue","name":"迈克尔","text":"小玛丽早上刚生过气，我答应过她不再主动接近小劳拉……不过……","id":149,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/92/Avg_avg_npc_1838_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"迈克尔","text":"让她主动接近我不就好了吗？","id":150,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/92/Avg_avg_npc_1838_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":151},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1.5","block":"true","id":152},{"type":"charslot","id":153},{"type":"playmusic","intro":"$loneliness_intro","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/static/m_avg/m_avg_loneliness_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":154,"musicid":1},{"type":"backgroundtween","xScaleFrom":"1.4","yScaleFrom":"1.4","xScaleTo":"1.4","yScaleTo":"1.4","xFrom":"100","xTo":"0","duration":"60","yFrom":"-90","yTo":"-90","id":155},{"type":"curtain","direction":"2","fillfrom":"0.01","fillto":"0.1","block":"false","id":156},{"type":"curtain","direction":"6","fillfrom":"0.01","fillto":"0.1","block":"true","id":157},{"type":"curtain","direction":"0","fillfrom":"0.01","fillto":"0.3","block":"false","id":158},{"type":"curtain","direction":"4","fillfrom":"0.01","fillto":"0.3","block":"true","id":159},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1.5","block":"true","id":160},{"type":"text","text":"迈克尔抬头向上看，劳拉纤瘦的身体被吊在空中，汗水一滴滴流下，打湿了一小片地板。","id":161},{"type":"text","text":"女孩的神情有些疲惫，眼神却依旧很坚定，隐隐刺痛了迈克尔玩世不恭的心。","id":162},{"type":"text","text":"威亚绳索咯吱咯吱地发出声响，迈克尔可以凭经验判断，劳拉穿戴的装置一定有什么不对劲的地方。","id":163},{"type":"text","text":"不过——","id":164},{"type":"dialogue","name":"迈克尔","text":"那不是正好吗？","id":165},{"type":"dialogue","name":"迈克尔","text":"小劳拉察觉到情况不对就会主动向我求救。","id":166},{"type":"dialogue","name":"迈克尔","text":"这样一来我既会成为她心目中的英雄，顺理成章地跟她温存，又不算违反我对小玛丽发的誓……两全其美！","id":167},{"type":"dialogue","name":"迈克尔","text":"再多吊一会儿吧。","id":168},{"type":"dialog","id":169},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1.5","block":"true","id":170},{"type":"charslot","id":171},{"type":"curtain","id":172},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/61/Avg_bg_62_g2_setting_rooftop.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":173},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":174},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1838_1#5$1","id":175},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1.5","block":"true","id":176},{"type":"dialogue","name":"迈克尔","text":"劳拉，为什么……为什么你还不向别人求助？我不是就在这里吗！","id":177,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/47/Avg_avg_npc_1838_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":178},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":179},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_wiatear","volume":"0.5","id":180},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":181},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1838_1#5$1","id":182},{"type":"dialogue","name":"迈克尔","text":"已经过去了好几个小时，绳索的声音越来越不对劲了……这是哪里找来的设备，怎么会如此老旧？","id":183,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/47/Avg_avg_npc_1838_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1838_1#6$1","id":184},{"type":"dialogue","name":"迈克尔","text":"那是……裂口？在保护绑带的地方？小劳拉不可能没注意到啊！","id":185,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/2e/Avg_avg_npc_1838_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1838_1#3$1","id":186},{"type":"dialogue","name":"迈克尔","text":"不行，我得提醒她，我得……","id":187,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/04/Avg_avg_npc_1838_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","duration":"1","id":188},{"type":"dialog","id":189},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_gen_walk_n","id":190},{"type":"text","text":"往前走的时候，迈克尔踩到了湿滑的水渍，在聚光灯强烈的高温中，劳拉逐渐处于脱水的状态。","id":191},{"type":"text","text":"这是迈克尔永远无法理解的坚持和热爱，眼前这个女孩仿佛否定了他从业以来的一切。","id":192},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1839_1#1$1","id":193},{"type":"dialogue","name":"玛丽昂","text":"咳。","id":194,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/56/Avg_avg_npc_1839_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","id":195},{"type":"text","text":"迈克尔回头，发现玛丽昂不知何时已经站在远处的墙角，眼神冰冷地看着自己和疲惫的女演员。","id":196},{"type":"text","text":"“哪怕她快死了都跟你没有关系……听明白了吗？”","id":197},{"type":"text","text":"迈克尔摸了摸头顶火红的耳朵，撤回了自己的脚步。","id":198},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1838_1#2$1","id":199},{"type":"dialogue","name":"迈克尔","text":"……既然你选择自己承受代价，那就跟我没有任何关系了。","id":200,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/dd/Avg_avg_npc_1838_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"迈克尔","text":"这是你要学的第一课，小劳拉。","id":201,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/dd/Avg_avg_npc_1838_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"迈克尔","text":"永远不要太认真，哪怕伤害他人也要保护自己，这才是最重要的——","id":202,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/dd/Avg_avg_npc_1838_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":203},{"type":"charslot","id":204},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_wiatear","id":205},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"1.5","xstrength":"2","ystrength":"7","vibrato":"3","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":206},{"type":"text","text":"咯吱，咯吱。","id":207},{"type":"text","text":"顶端的绳索已经拉伸到了极限。","id":208},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1838_1#5$1","id":209},{"type":"dialogue","name":"迈克尔","text":"你还不求救吗？","id":210,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/47/Avg_avg_npc_1838_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":211},{"type":"charslot","id":212},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":213},{"type":"cameraeffect","effect":"Grayscale","fadetime":"2","keep":"true","initamount":"0","amount":"1","block":"true","id":214},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0.5","block":"true","id":215},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":216},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_wiatear_break","id":217},{"type":"playsound","key":"$glass","delay":"1","id":218},{"type":"dialog","id":219},{"type":"charslot","id":220},{"type":"delay","time":"4","id":221},{"type":"cameraeffect","effect":"Grayscale","fadetime":"0","amount":"0","block":"true","id":222},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/5c/Avg_bg_62_g12_dressingroom.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":223},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":224},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":225},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"0.3","xstrength":"30","ystrength":"30","vibrato":"30","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":226},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1838_1#3$1","id":227},{"type":"dialogue","name":"迈克尔","text":"啊——！！","id":228,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/04/Avg_avg_npc_1838_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1839_1#3$1","id":229},{"type":"dialogue","name":"玛丽昂","text":"迈克尔？","id":230,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a6/Avg_avg_npc_1839_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"玛丽昂","text":"迈克尔，你怎么了？你想到什么了？","id":231,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a6/Avg_avg_npc_1839_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1839_1#6$1","id":232},{"type":"dialogue","name":"玛丽昂","text":"我跟你来到化妆间是要听你解释的，不是看你一惊一乍地发神经的……","id":233,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/5d/Avg_avg_npc_1839_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"玛丽昂","text":"莫伊拉说，你想离开这个地块，到底是什么意思？","id":234,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/5d/Avg_avg_npc_1839_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1838_1#4$1","id":235},{"type":"dialogue","name":"迈克尔","text":"亲爱的，我得带着你逃离这里！","id":236,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/e7/Avg_avg_npc_1838_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":237},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":238},{"type":"charslot","id":239},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":240},{"type":"playmusic","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/rogue_1/m_avg_rglk1secretevent_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":241,"musicid":2},{"type":"sticker","id":242,"multi":"true","text":"重大公告：","x":"220","y":"270","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"800","block":"true"},{"type":"sticker","id":243,"multi":"true","text":"\\n\\n维多利亚知名云游剧团“猩红剧团”即将到达莱蒙镇，奉献为期三天的精彩演出，不容错过！","block":"true"},{"type":"sticker","id":244,"multi":"true","text":"\\n\\n门票有限，先到先得！","block":"true"},{"type":"sticker","id":245,"duration":"1"},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":246},{"type":"cameraeffect","effect":"Grayscale","fadetime":"0","keep":"true","initamount":"0","amount":"1","block":"true","id":247},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/50/Avg_bg_bg_county_1.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":248},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":249},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":250},{"type":"cameraeffect","effect":"Grayscale","fadetime":"2","amount":"0","block":"true","id":251},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1829_1#1$1","duration":"1","id":252},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":253},{"type":"dialogue","name":"剧团长","text":"这是你第一次离开古堡，随剧团到这么远的地方演出吧？","id":254,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/fc/Avg_avg_npc_1829_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1841_1#1$1","id":255},{"type":"dialogue","name":"小卢西恩","text":"嗯。","id":256,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4a/Avg_avg_npc_1841_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1829_1#1$1","id":257},{"type":"dialogue","name":"剧团长","text":"紧张吗？","id":258,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/fc/Avg_avg_npc_1829_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1841_1#1$1","id":259},{"type":"dialogue","name":"小卢西恩","text":"……还好，老师。","id":260,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4a/Avg_avg_npc_1841_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"小卢西恩","text":"其他老师们才是主演，我只是助演一个很小很小的角色，在舞台上绝大多数的戏份也只是旁观……","id":261,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4a/Avg_avg_npc_1841_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1829_1#11$1","id":262},{"type":"dialogue","name":"剧团长","text":"但当真正的演出在你面前发生，忍住不逃开，并没有那么简单。","id":263,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1f/Avg_avg_npc_1829_1-11$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"剧团长","text":"孩子，这是你新的一课。","id":264,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1f/Avg_avg_npc_1829_1-11$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":265},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":266},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":267},{"type":"sticker","id":268,"multi":"true","text":"关于莱蒙镇血案的调查公告：","x":"220","y":"270","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"800","block":"true"},{"type":"sticker","id":269,"multi":"true","text":"\\n\\n尚不能确定本案与日前经过此间的猩红剧团存在直接联系，警方已成立特殊调查组跟进，尝试寻找其他线索。","block":"true"},{"type":"sticker","id":270,"duration":"1"},{"type":"charslot","id":271},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":272},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/23/Avg_bg_44_g6_towerterrace.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":273},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":274},{"type":"text","text":"莱塔尼亚，鲁珀坎大区，某高塔","id":275},{"type":"dialog","id":276},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":277},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_clapsolo","volume":"1","id":278},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1829_1#11$1","duration":"1","id":279},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":280},{"type":"dialogue","name":"剧团长","text":"（鼓掌）","id":281,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1f/Avg_avg_npc_1829_1-11$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"剧团长","text":"精彩的演出。","id":282,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1f/Avg_avg_npc_1829_1-11$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":283},{"type":"charslot","id":284},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1832_1#2$1","duration":"1","id":285},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":286},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卢西恩","text":"……","id":287,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b8/Avg_avg_npc_1832_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1829_1#1$1","id":288},{"type":"dialogue","name":"剧团长","text":"自从顺利完成自己第一次作为主演的剧目后，你终于突破了瓶颈。","id":289,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/fc/Avg_avg_npc_1829_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"剧团长","text":"你颈部细小的黑色结晶被遮掩得不留痕迹。观众只当你是璀璨夺目的主演，却不知你已成为迫近死亡的感染者。","id":290,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/fc/Avg_avg_npc_1829_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1829_1#12$1","id":291},{"type":"dialogue","name":"剧团长","text":"如今，你的表演越发纯熟，你的歌声越发震撼人心，卢西恩……几乎看不出一丝匠气。","id":292,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/9c/Avg_avg_npc_1829_1-12$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1832_1#1$1","id":293},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卢西恩","text":"这是夸奖？","id":294,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/34/Avg_avg_npc_1832_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1829_1#1$1","id":295},{"type":"dialogue","name":"剧团长","text":"当然。","id":296,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/fc/Avg_avg_npc_1829_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"剧团长","text":"不走吗？还是说，你想要在这里多待一会儿，再享受一会儿舞台的余韵？","id":297,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/fc/Avg_avg_npc_1829_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1832_1#1$1","id":298},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卢西恩","text":"余韵？","id":299,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/34/Avg_avg_npc_1832_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1832_1#4$1","id":300},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卢西恩","text":"你是指，这些血腥味？","id":301,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/3c/Avg_avg_npc_1832_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":302},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":303},{"type":"charslot","id":304},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":305},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/61/Avg_bg_bg_wilderness_y.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":306},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":307},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":308},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1832_1#2$1","duration":"1","id":309},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":310},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","action":"zoom","poszoom":"0.5,0.5","scale":"0.9","name":"avg_npc_045_nn_1#1","afrom":"0","ato":"0","id":311},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","afrom":"0","ato":"1","duration":"1","posfrom":"-200,0","posto":"0,0","id":312},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":313},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","focus":"l","id":314},{"type":"dialogue","name":"懵懂的孩童","text":"大哥哥，请让让，你挡住路了。","id":315},{"type":"dialogue","name":"懵懂的孩童","text":"我要过去，我要回家。","id":316},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1832_1#2$1","focus":"r","id":317},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卢西恩","text":"……","id":318,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b8/Avg_avg_npc_1832_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","id":319},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1829_1#1$1","id":320},{"type":"dialogue","name":"剧团长","text":"我想，猩红剧团可以收留这个孩子。","id":321,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/fc/Avg_avg_npc_1829_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1832_1#1$1","id":322},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卢西恩","text":"收留？","id":323,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/34/Avg_avg_npc_1832_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1832_1#5$1","id":324},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卢西恩","text":"她并不知晓，自己的家乡已经不复存在，她并不知晓，此刻自己面前的这支队伍里，或许有些人身上还残留着她至亲的血腥味……","id":325,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/52/Avg_avg_npc_1832_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1829_1#2$1","id":326},{"type":"dialogue","name":"剧团长","text":"宿命的相逢，不是吗？","id":327,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/02/Avg_avg_npc_1829_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"剧团长","text":"就像曾经的你与剧团一样。","id":328,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/02/Avg_avg_npc_1829_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"剧团长","text":"或许，我应该让你来当这个孩子的老师，教她怎样融入剧团，怎样拥抱新的人生……教她，重走一遍你的来路。","id":329,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/02/Avg_avg_npc_1829_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1832_1#1$1","id":330},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卢西恩","text":"下台之后，演出继续？","id":331,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/34/Avg_avg_npc_1832_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1829_1#1$1","id":332},{"type":"dialogue","name":"剧团长","text":"唔，你还记得我说过的话。","id":333,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/fc/Avg_avg_npc_1829_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"剧团长","text":"是啊，生活本身便是最好的戏剧，宿命的美学从不局限于载体。","id":334,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/fc/Avg_avg_npc_1829_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":335},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_gen_walk_n","id":336},{"type":"charslot","duration":"1","id":337},{"type":"delay","time":"2.5","id":338},{"type":"charslot","id":339},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","action":"zoom","poszoom":"0.5,0.5","scale":"0.9","name":"avg_npc_045_nn_1#1","id":340},{"type":"dialogue","name":"懵懂的孩童","text":"……大哥哥？","id":341,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/20/Avg_avg_npc_045_nn_1.png"},{"type":"charslot","id":342},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1832_1#2$1","id":343},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卢西恩","text":"……","id":344,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b8/Avg_avg_npc_1832_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","id":345},{"type":"dialog","id":346},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_gen_walk_n","id":347},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1833_1#1$1","duration":"1","id":348},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":349},{"type":"dialogue","name":"沉渊","text":"怎么样，卢西恩？","id":350,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/54/Avg_avg_npc_1833_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"沉渊","text":"你考虑清楚了吗？现在的你，应该能决定了吧？","id":351,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/54/Avg_avg_npc_1833_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":352},{"type":"cameraeffect","effect":"Grayscale","fadetime":"2","keep":"true","initamount":"0","amount":"1","block":"true","id":353},{"type":"dialog","id":354},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":355},{"type":"charslot","id":356},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":357},{"type":"cameraeffect","effect":"Grayscale","fadetime":"0","amount":"0","block":"true","id":358},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1b/Avg_bg_62_g10_dormitory.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":359},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":360},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":361},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_npc_1828_1#3$1","duration":"1","id":362},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_4198_christ_1#1$1","duration":"1","id":363},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":364},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_npc_1828_1#1$1","id":365},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":366},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_4198_christ_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":367},{"type":"dialogue","name":"Miss.Christine","text":"清醒了？","id":368,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/01/Avg_avg_4198_christ_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_npc_1828_1#1$1","focus":"l","text":"","id":369},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卢西恩","text":"……","id":370,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/54/Avg_avg_npc_1828_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_4198_christ_1#4$1","focus":"r","id":371},{"type":"dialogue","name":"Miss.Christine","text":"（慵懒的哈欠）","id":372,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/99/Avg_avg_4198_christ_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_npc_1828_1#2$1","focus":"l","id":373},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卢西恩","text":"怎么了，女士？","id":374,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1f/Avg_avg_npc_1828_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_4198_christ_1#5$1","focus":"r","id":375},{"type":"dialogue","name":"Miss.Christine","text":"执拗的涩味……你的情绪。","id":376,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c2/Avg_avg_4198_christ_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_npc_1828_1#2$1","focus":"l","id":377},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卢西恩","text":"难以下咽？","id":378,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1f/Avg_avg_npc_1828_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_4198_christ_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":379},{"type":"dialogue","name":"Miss.Christine","text":"倒是谈不上。","id":380,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/01/Avg_avg_4198_christ_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"Miss.Christine","text":"不过来到这个地块以后，你回想过往的次数越发多了。","id":381,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/01/Avg_avg_4198_christ_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_npc_1828_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":382},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卢西恩","text":"这说明我们正在靠近他。","id":383,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/54/Avg_avg_npc_1828_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_4198_christ_1#3$1","focus":"r","id":384},{"type":"dialogue","name":"Miss.Christine","text":"你敏锐地察觉到了那个统筹的异样。","id":385,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/e2/Avg_avg_4198_christ_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_npc_1828_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":386},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卢西恩","text":"如你。","id":387,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/54/Avg_avg_npc_1828_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_npc_1828_1#5$1","focus":"l","id":388},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卢西恩","text":"遗憾，我尚未能挖出更多的线索，她的惨剧便已经发生。","id":389,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/ea/Avg_avg_npc_1828_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_4198_christ_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":390},{"type":"dialogue","name":"Miss.Christine","text":"你利用了那个摄影助理，你故意抖出天灾的消息？","id":391,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/01/Avg_avg_4198_christ_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_npc_1828_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":392},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卢西恩","text":"那份文件出现的时机和方式都太过巧合，女士。","id":393,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/54/Avg_avg_npc_1828_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卢西恩","text":"参演过足够多的剧目，便不难知晓，当这样明显的线索出现在我们面前，它便一定会发挥作用，推动故事往下进行。","id":394,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/54/Avg_avg_npc_1828_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卢西恩","text":"道尔顿的死，只是一个开头。","id":395,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/54/Avg_avg_npc_1828_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_npc_1828_1#4$1","focus":"l","id":396},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卢西恩","text":"所有的伏笔已被铺陈，一切的脉络已被写定，没有人能扯回已经拉开的大幕。","id":397,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/13/Avg_avg_npc_1828_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卢西恩","text":"唯有，唯有让故事来到谢幕前的高潮，作者才会现身。","id":398,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/13/Avg_avg_npc_1828_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_npc_1828_1#2$1","focus":"l","id":399},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卢西恩","text":"……而我才能，杀死他。","id":400,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1f/Avg_avg_npc_1828_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_4198_christ_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":401},{"type":"dialogue","name":"Miss.Christine","text":"（哈欠）","id":402,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/01/Avg_avg_4198_christ_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"Miss.Christine","text":"当心点，卢西恩。","id":403,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/01/Avg_avg_4198_christ_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_npc_1828_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":404},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卢西恩","text":"我知道。","id":405,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/54/Avg_avg_npc_1828_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_4198_christ_1#4$1","focus":"r","id":406},{"type":"dialogue","name":"Miss.Christine","text":"我是说，当心你自己。","id":407,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/99/Avg_avg_4198_christ_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"Miss.Christine","text":"我刚刚说过，你的情绪，充满了执拗的涩味……这很危险。","id":408,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/99/Avg_avg_4198_christ_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_npc_1828_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":409},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卢西恩","text":"……","id":410,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/54/Avg_avg_npc_1828_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卢西恩","text":"我向你道歉，Miss.Christine。","id":411,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/54/Avg_avg_npc_1828_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卢西恩","text":"我不会让你忍受太久。","id":412,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/54/Avg_avg_npc_1828_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":413},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":414},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":415},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":416},{"type":"image","id":417},{"type":"charslot","id":418}],"characters":["劳拉","道尔顿","谢莉","迈克尔","玛丽昂","工作人员","剧团长","小卢西恩","卢西恩","懵懂的孩童","沉渊","Miss.Christine"]}